<%- include('_partials/head') %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>

<main class="container page-container">
    <section class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Economic Model</span>
        <h1>Points & Fulfillment</h1>
        <p class="lead">
            Kurukoo uses a transparent Points system to power the orchestration network and ensure secure fulfillment.
        </p>
    </section>

    <div class="points-grid">
        <div class="points-card">
            <h3>What are Points?</h3>
            <p>Points are Kurukoo's internal utility tokens. They power the interaction between you and the network.</p>
            <ul class="points-usage">
                <li><strong>Request Services</strong>: Use Points to start conversations and coordinate tasks.</li>
                <li><strong>Unlock Leads</strong>: Providers use Points to access verified request details.</li>
                <li><strong>Boost Visibility</strong>: Highlight your skills or business in the network.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="points-card">
            <h3>Earning Points</h3>
            <p>The Kurukoo economy is circular. You can earn Points in several ways:</p>
            <ul class="points-usage">
                <li><strong>Daily Engagement</strong>: Active users receive daily Point allowances.</li>
                <li><strong>Completed Jobs</strong>: Earn Points by successfully fulfilling requests.</li>
                <li><strong>Referrals</strong>: Invite others to join the orchestration network.</li>
                <li><strong>Contributions</strong>: Complete micro-tasks to keep the network accurate.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="fulfillment-section">
        <h2>How Fulfillment Works</h2>
        <div class="fulfillment-steps">
            <div class="fulfillment-step">
                <div class="f-icon">🔒</div>
                <h4>Secure Escrow</h4>
                <p>When you agree on a price, Kurukoo holds the funds in secure escrow. The provider is only paid once fulfillment is verified.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="fulfillment-step">
                <div class="f-icon">📝</div>
                <h4>Evidence & Tracking</h4>
                <p>Providers and delivery partners record evidence of progress directly in the conversation. You see the status in real-time.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="fulfillment-step">
                <div class="f-icon">🛡️</div>
                <h4>Dispute Protection</h4>
                <p>If something goes wrong, Kurukoo's dispute policy protects both parties. Funds remain in escrow until the issue is resolved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="subscription-tiers">
        <h2 class="text-center">Subscription Tiers</h2>
        <div class="tier-grid">
            <div class="tier-card">
                <h3>Base</h3>
                <div class="tier-price">Free</div>
                <p>30 Daily Points included. Standard access to the network.</p>
                <a href="/chat" class="btn btn-outline btn-block">Start Chatting</a>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-card featured">
                <span class="badge">Recommended</span>
                <h3>Plus</h3>
                <div class="tier-price">₦2,500/mo</div>
                <p>60 Daily Points. Priority matching and proactive nudges.</p>
                <a href="/chat?prompt=I%20want%20to%20upgrade%20to%20Plus" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Upgrade to Plus</a>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-card">
                <h3>Business</h3>
                <div class="tier-price">₦10,000/mo</div>
                <p>120 Daily Points. Verified storefront and bulk catalog tools.</p>
                <a href="/chat?prompt=I%20want%20to%20register%20a%20business" class="btn btn-outline btn-block">Register Business</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<style>
.points-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; margin: 60px 0; }
.points-card { padding: 32px; background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--gray-200); border-radius: var(--border-radius); }
.points-usage { list-style: none; margin-top: 20px; }
.points-usage li { margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.points-usage li::before { content: '•'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--terracotta); font-weight: bold; }

.fulfillment-section { background: var(--gray-50); padding: 60px 40px; border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg); margin-bottom: 60px; }
.fulfillment-section h2 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
.fulfillment-steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 32px; }
.fulfillment-step { text-align: center; }
.f-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }

.tier-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-top: 40px; }
.tier-card { padding: 40px 32px; background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--gray-200); border-radius: var(--border-radius); text-align: center; position: relative; }
.tier-card.featured { border-color: var(--terracotta); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(217,122,92,0.1); transform: scale(1.05); z-index: 2; }
.tier-price { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 16px 0; color: var(--terracotta); }
.tier-card .badge { position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: var(--terracotta); color: white; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .points-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tier-card.featured { transform: none; margin: 20px 0; }
}
</style>

<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
